OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome bright or sunny spells
OL,6,Fdeveloping during the day but these
OL,7,Finterspersed with cloudier conditions
OL,8,Fand showers, which may be heavy. Still
OL,9,Fbreezy but winds generally easing.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FVariable cloud with clear
OL,12,Fspells and showers through the
OL,13,Fevening, some heavy at times. Clear
OL,14,Fspells and showers continuing
OL,15,Fovernight. Breezy at first, then winds
OL,16,Feasing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
