OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,6,Fthe day with scattered showers in the
OL,7,Fmorning, which may be heavy. Showers
OL,8,Feasing through the afternoon leading
OL,9,Fto dry conditions in the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,12,Fdry with sunny spells Saturday, but
OL,13,Fthe odd light shower possible. Dry
OL,14,Fwith bright or sunny spells and winds
OL,15,Fstrengthening Sunday. Dry and mostly
OL,16,Fcloudy Monday with strong winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
